{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38711","headline":"赠天台王处士 · 林嵩","name":"赠天台王处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深隐天台不记秋，琴台长别一何愁。\n茶烟岩外云初起，新月潭心钓未收。\n映宇异花丛发好，穿松孤鹤一声幽。\n赤城不掩高宗梦，宁久悬冠枕瀑流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林嵩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}